1. Mechanics
- GET /mechanics - Get all mechanics.
- GET /mechanics/{id} - Get a specific mechanic.
- POST /mechanics - Register a new mechanic.
- PUT /mechanics/{id} - Replace all details of a mechanic.
- PATCH /mechanics/{id} - Partially update mechanic details.
- DELETE /mechanics/{id} - Delete a mechanic.
2. Vehicles
- GET /vehicles - Get all vehicles.
- GET /vehicles/{id} - Get a specific vehicle.
- POST /vehicles - Register a new vehicle.
- PUT /vehicles/{id} - Replace all vehicle details.
- PATCH /vehicles/{id} - Partially update vehicle details.
- DELETE /vehicles/{id} - Delete a vehicle.
3. Service Centres
- GET /service-centres - Get service centres.
- GET /service-centres/{id} - Get details of a specific service centre.
- POST /service-centres - Register a new service centre.
- PUT /service-centres/{id} - Replace all service centre details.
- PATCH /service-centres/{id} - Partially update service centre details.
4. Service Visits
- GET /service-visits - Get all service visits.
- GET /service-visits/{id} - Get details of a specific service visit.
- POST /service-visits - Create a service visit.
- PUT /service-visits/{id} - Replace all service visit details.
- PATCH /service-visits/{id} - Partially update service visit details.
5. Roadside Assistance
- POST /assistance-requests - Create a roadside assistance request.
- GET /assistance-requests/{id} - Get details of an assistance request.
- PUT /assistance-requests/{id} - Replace all assistance request details.
- PATCH /assistance-requests/{id} - Partially update an assistance request, such as its status.
- DELETE /assistance-requests/{id} - Cancel an assistance request.
6. Community Pings
- POST /pings - Create a ping requesting help from nearby users.
- GET /pings/{id} - Get details of a specific ping.
- GET /pings/{id}/recipients - Get the users who received the ping.
- PUT /pings/{id} - Replace all ping details.
- PATCH /pings/{id} - Partially update ping details or status.
- DELETE /pings/{id} - Delete or cancel a ping.